{"format":"telly-addicts-eps","v":1,"show":"She-Ra","i":9172,"eps":[{"s":1,"e":1,"t":"Into Etheria","a":"1985-09-09","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/539/1348561.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":2,"t":"Beast Island","a":"1985-09-10","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/540/1350114.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":3,"t":"She-Ra Unchained","a":"1985-09-11","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/541/1354465.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":4,"t":"Reunions","a":"1985-09-12","l":30,"d":"Continuing the story of the previous three episodes, He-Man and She-Ra find out they are twins who were separated while infants by Skeletor and Hordak. Skeletor, a pupil of Hordak, was left behind by his master and in return he betrayed him to save his skin.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/543/1359781.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":5,"t":"Battle for Bright Moon","a":"1985-09-13","l":30,"d":"The end of a five-episode pilot for She-Ra which continues on the previous 4 episodes. Skeletor and Hordak join forces and kidnap Princess Adora. But Hordak doesn't return to his planet with her, instead, Skeletor betrays him and tries to blackmail King Randor. But Adora manages to escape Beastman and gets her sword.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/543/1359784.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":6,"t":"The Sea Hawk","a":"1985-09-16","l":30,"d":"Adora runs into Sky Hawk, a pirate captain, who is trading goods with The Horde. After realising who she is, he orders his men to capture Adora and hand her to Catra and the Horde. While on her way back to port HQ, Catra is looking forward to her reward for capturing Adora, but the pirate captain has a change of heart and decides to go after Catra and save Adora.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/543/1359794.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":7,"t":"The Red Knight","a":"1985-09-17","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/544/1360378.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":8,"t":"The Missing Ax","a":"1985-09-18","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/544/1361440.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":9,"t":"The Prisoners of Beast Island","a":"1985-09-19","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/550/1376646.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":10,"t":"The Peril of Whispering Woods","a":"1985-09-20","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/544/1361449.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":11,"t":"The Laughing Dragon","a":"1985-09-23","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/544/1361447.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":12,"t":"King Miro's Journey","a":"1985-09-24","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/550/1376651.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":13,"t":"Friendship","a":"1985-09-25","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/550/1376657.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":14,"t":"He Ain't Heavy","a":"1985-09-26","l":30,"d":"Shadow Weaver and Grizzlor steal the magic mirror from an old wizard. Hordak then uses that mirror to snatch prince Adam from Eternia and blackmail princess Adora to come and surrender. But when Adora comes as She-Ra and frees Adam who finds a spot to turn into He-Man, Hordak tries to use the mirror once again to capture king Randor.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/551/1377871.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":15,"t":"Return of the Sea Hawk","a":"1985-09-27","l":30,"d":"Catra has a plan to capture Sea Hawk and Princess Adora, but when She-Ra appears her plan changes to capture her as well.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/552/1380635.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":16,"t":"Duel at Devlan","a":"1985-12-06","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/543/1359790.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":17,"t":"A Loss for Words","a":"1985-09-30","l":30,"d":"To quell rebellion that may be inspired by talkative villagers, Shadow Weaver finds a way to take the people's voices. When princess Adora loses her voice as well, she needs to find a way to restore it because without it she cannot say the magic words and transform into She-Ra.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/552/1380638.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":18,"t":"Horde Prime Takes a Holiday","a":"1985-10-01","l":30,"d":"Horde Prime takes a holiday and Hordak decides to use their flagship to take over everything. But Skeletor seems that and decides to steal the ship for himself and use it to rule over Eternia. Needless to say, She-Ra and He-Man mess up both their plans, and the fact that Skeletor and Hordak battle it out amongst themselves just plays against them.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/429/1074673.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":19,"t":"Enchanted Castle","a":"1985-10-02","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/463/1157754.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":20,"t":"Three Courageous Hearts","a":"1985-10-03","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/484/1212105.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":21,"t":"The Stone in the Sword","a":"1985-10-04","l":30,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/533/1334011.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":22,"t":"The Crystal Castle","a":"1985-10-07","l":30},{"s":1,"e":23,"t":"The Crown of Knowledge","a":"1985-10-08","l":30},{"s":1,"e":24,"t":"The Mines of Mondor","a":"1985-10-09","l":30},{"s":1,"e":25,"t":"Small Problems","a":"1985-10-10","l":30},{"s":1,"e":26,"t":"Book Burning","a":"1985-10-11","l":30},{"s":1,"e":27,"t":"The Eldritch Mist","a":"1985-10-14","l":30},{"s":1,"e":28,"t":"Bow's Farewell","a":"1985-10-15","l":30},{"s":1,"e":29,"t":"The Price of Freedom","a":"1985-10-16","l":30},{"s":1,"e":30,"t":"Play It Again, Bow","a":"1985-10-17","l":30},{"s":1,"e":31,"t":"The Reluctant Wizard","a":"1985-10-18","l":30},{"s":1,"e":32,"t":"Friends Are Where You Find Them","a":"1985-10-21","l":30},{"s":1,"e":33,"t":"A Talent for Trouble","a":"1985-10-22"